<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms pass on 31,000T rapemeal tender.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms pass on 31,000T rapemeal tender.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean buyer group, the Feed Buying Group, on Friday passed on tenders to buy 31,000 tonnes of rapeseed meal due to high offer prices, traders said.  </p>
<p>But the group bought 7,500 tonnes of palm kernel meal from Toepfer and another 4,000 tonnes from Nidera, the traders said.</p>
<p>They said the group also bought 6,200 tonnes of Chinese cottonseed meal from Sunkyong Ltd at $157.50 C&amp;F but passed on tenders for another 7,300 tonnes due to high offer prices.</p>
<p>Arrival was set for the western port of Inchon, they said.  </p>
<p>Details of the tender results were as follows:</p>
<p> COMMODITY	    TONNE    ARRIVAL   PRICE    SELLER</p>
<p> Cottonseed meal    6,200    Aug 20    $157.50  Sunkyong</p>
<p> Cottonseed meal    7,300    Sep 20    PASSED</p>
<p> Rapeseed meal     15,000    Aug 20    PASSED</p>
<p> Rapeseed meal     16,000    Sep 20    PASSED</p>
<p> Palm kernel meal   3,500    Jul 15    $95.92   Toepfer</p>
<p> Palm kernel meal   4,000    Aug 30    $95.92   Toepfer</p>
<p> Palm kernel meal   4,000    Oct 15    $97.97   Nidera</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
